OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate CEO's
OL,4,Aaffair with suspected Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS tech giant Nvidia opens an
OL,7,Findependent investigation into claims
OL,8,Fits CEO Jensen Huang had an affair with
OL,9,Fa Chinese spy
OL,11,FIn a statement on Sunday, Huang
OL,12,Fadmitted to being unfaithful to his
OL,13,Fwife, adding he backs the investigation
OL,14,Fand is committed to "supporting
OL,15,FAmerica's national security"
OL,17,FNvidia - one of the most valuable firms
OL,18,Fin the world - says it has no reason to
OL,19,Fbelieve its secrets or national
OL,20,Fsecurity were compromised, but it will
OL,21,F"examine all available information"
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  BusinessC Nat TVF  Nat News
FL,107,105,200,300,0,100
