OL,3,ATech giant Nvidia to investigate CEO's
OL,4,Aaffair with suspected Chinese spy
OL,5,
OL,6,FDonald Trump says Huang is "a fine
OL,7,Fperson, but you never know what's going
OL,8,Fon"
OL,10,FMeanwhile, the Chinese government says
OL,11,Fthe claims are nothing more than a
OL,12,F"smear intended to malign China"
OL,14,FThe New York Times first reported last
OL,15,Fmonth that Huang had a close
OL,16,Frelationship with Alice Huang, a boss
OL,17,Fat a Singapore-based data centre
OL,18,Fcompany - and that she was suspected of
OL,19,Fgiving information to China
